title: The Dawn of APRA
new-page: true

= THE DAWN OF APRA

= PERU, MARCH 1985

**The road to the presidency begins here.**

You are Alan García, leader and presidential candidate of APRA, preparing for the Peruvian general election on 14 April 1985.

Organise your party, prepare your economic programme, negotiate with political allies and respond to the challenges facing Peru.

Every decision will shape your campaign and the future government.

- @start: Begin the campaign

